{"name":"Bellflower","hex":"#5d66aa","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Bellflower","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A city in Los Angeles County, California, United States.","A village in Illinois, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Bellflower"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bellflower, California","blocks":[{"text":"Bellflower is a city in southeastern Los Angeles County, California, in the Los Angeles metropolitan area. It was founded in 1906 and incorporated on September 3, 1957. As of the 2020 census, the city had a total population of 79,190, up from 76,616 at the 2010 census. This made it the 65th-most densely populated city in the United States of cities over 50,000 residents."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Bellflower%2C_CA_City_Hall.jpg/330px-Bellflower%2C_CA_City_Hall.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bellflower%2C_California","wikidata":"Q815979"},{"title":"Bellflower, Illinois","blocks":[{"text":"Bellflower is a village in McLean County, Illinois, United States. The population was 346 at the 2020 census. It is part of the Bloomington–Normal Metropolitan Statistical Area."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/McLean_County_Illinois_Incorporated_and_Unincorporated_areas_Bellflower_Highlighted.svg/330px-McLean_County_Illinois_Incorporated_and_Unincorporated_areas_Bellflower_Highlighted.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bellflower%2C_Illinois","wikidata":"Q2671663"},{"title":"Bellflower (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Bellflower is a 2011 American film written and directed by Evan Glodell. It was produced on a shoestring budget in Ventura, California, and premiered in January 2011 at the Sundance Film Festival. The film was nominated for the Independent Spirit John Cassavetes Award for best feature film made for under\n$500,000."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/14/Bellflower_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bellflower_(film)","wikidata":"Q2894928"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Seal_of_Bellflower%2C_California.gif/120px-Seal_of_Bellflower%2C_California.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/Seal_of_Bellflower%2C_California.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Seal_of_Bellflower%2C_California.gif/120px-Seal_of_Bellflower%2C_California.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASeal_of_Bellflower%2C_California.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Bellflower_memorial_1.jpg/500px-Bellflower_memorial_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Bellflower_memorial_1.jpg/1280px-Bellflower_memorial_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Bellflower_memorial_1.jpg/500px-Bellflower_memorial_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Veterans Memorial at Library Garden park","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABellflower_memorial_1.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Bellflower%2C_Los_Angeles_County%2C_California_-_2025_February_06.jpg/500px-Bellflower%2C_Los_Angeles_County%2C_California_-_2025_February_06.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https